## 🔒 Security

- **OS Credential Store & Sealed OAuth Client Vault**:
  - Stores AI provider API keys and email/calendar OAuth tokens in the native OS credential manager (`SecretStore`: macOS Keychain, Windows Credential Manager, Linux Secret Service) with AES-256-GCM sealed OAuth client envelopes (`OAuthClientVault`) and automatic migration from legacy plain-text preferences.
- **BSL 1.1 Evaluation Attestation & Commercial License Activation**:
  - Added in-app license status inspection, evaluation attestation, and commercial license key activation in Studio (**Help > License…**).
- **SSRF Protection**:
  - Blocked link-local and cloud-metadata addresses in `WebFetch` to prevent SSRF vulnerabilities.

