## 🔧 Improvements

- **Multiple AI Service Connections per Provider**:
  - Configure and switch between multiple named LLM connections per provider (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google Gemini, OpenAI-compatible/local endpoints) in `SettingsDialog` (`General & AI Services`) and `llm.json`.
- **Unified Studio Settings & Docked Process Panels**:
  - Added dedicated **Agent Hub**, **Inference Server** (including Hugging Face LLM model ID configuration), **Email Accounts**, and **Calendar Accounts** tabs in `SettingsDialog`.
  - Replaced floating process windows with docked `ProcessPanel` tabs in the Workspace editor area, with automatic subprocess shutdown when Studio exits.
