  - Defaulted Studio UI theme to Light with a **File > Dark Theme** toggle, monochrome High-DPI action icons, and full localization across all supported workspace locales.
- **Lighter `smile-base` Runtime Footprint & JDBC Enhancements**:
  - Scoped optional I/O and SQL dependencies as `compileOnly` / `Provided` in `smile-base` and added `JDBCType.OTHER` mapping support in `smile.data`.
- **Dependency Upgrades**:
