## 🐛 Bug Fixes & Reliability

- **LLM Inference Engine & Hybrid Prefix Reuse (`smile-deep`)**:
  - Fixed a race condition in `InferenceEngine` that could bypass idle admission coalescing.
  - Fixed hybrid prefix reuse applying the last prompt token to the DeltaNet recurrent state twice.
  - Suppressed spurious history-invalidation log warnings on normal MTP request release.
- **Studio Editor, Markdown Preview & Bot Transcripts (`smile-studio`)**:
  - Fixed emoji and supplementary Unicode character tokenization in `ThemedTextArea`.
  - Normalized HTML5 void elements in Markdown preview, fixed horizontal overflow and emoji fallback in code blocks, and added automatic fallback to Edit mode.
  - Removed the 12,000-character truncation cap in Bot Activity session transcripts and matched local bot run transcripts by `startedAt` when `conversationPath` points to the sessions directory.
- **JSON I/O, Banded Matrix & Native Image Hardening**:
  - Migrated `smile.io.JSON` to Jackson v3 (`tools.jackson.*`), fixed `BandMatrix.mv` with `UPLO.LOWER` in native CBLAS, and registered GraalVM native reflection and FFM reachability metadata for `smile-serve`.

